Package: kachaning
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: miahke <https://github.com/miahke>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, pkexec | policykit-1, openssh-client, sudo, systemd
Recommends: openssh-server, libnotify-bin, xdg-utils
Suggests: tailscale
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/miahke/kachaning
Description: remote help between friends over Tailscale
 GTK app for helping a friend with their Linux PC: SSH access over Tailscale,
 time-limited administrator rights that are revoked automatically, key
 management and a connection checklist. Russian and English interface.
